{"unit":5,"items":17,"pass":12,"title":"Unit Test · Unit 5","html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Unit Test\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Unit 5 &middot; Unit Test</div>\n      <h2>Every day</h2>\n      <p>Seventeen questions on Lessons 13&ndash;15: routines, frequency, questions. Answer them all, then press Check. You need <b>12 out of 17</b> to pass &mdash; and you can take this test as many times as you like.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"review-u5\">\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Part 1 &middot; Grammar and vocabulary &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 1&ndash;12</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Choose the correct answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ up at seven.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">gets</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">get</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">getting</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ TV in the evening.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">watchs</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">watch</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">watches</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ drink coffee. (100%)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">always</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">rarely</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">never</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">She ___ eats meat. (0%)\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">never</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">usually</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">always</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">I ___ like tea.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">doesn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">am not</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">He ___ work on Sundays.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">isn't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">doesn't</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">___ do you live? — In Almaty.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">What</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Who</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Where</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">___ do you like it? — Because it's fun.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">Where</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Why</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Who</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"body\">What time ___ she get up?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">does</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">do</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">10</span><span class=\"body\">How often ___ you read?\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">does</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">do</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"body\">My brother ___ breakfast at eight.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">has</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">haves</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">have</button></div></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">12</span><span class=\"body\">I always ___ to bed at eleven.\n        <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">going</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">go</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">goes</button></div></span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">Part 2 &middot; Write the answer &nbsp;<span class=\"qcount\">questions 13&ndash;17</span></div>\n\n      <p class=\"subline\">Type your answer. Spelling counts; capital letters and full stops do not. &middot; В письменных ответах важна орфография; заглавные буквы и точки &mdash; нет.</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">13</span><span class=\"body\">Change to SHE: I get up at six.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She gets up at six.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">14</span><span class=\"body\">Make it negative: I watch TV.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"I don't watch TV.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">15</span><span class=\"body\">Ask about the place: he works<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Where does he work?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">16</span><span class=\"body\">Fix the mistake: She don't eat meat.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"She doesn't eat meat.\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">17</span><span class=\"body\">Ask: how often / you / cook<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How often do you cook?\" placeholder=\"Type your answer&hellip;\"></span></div>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"checkReview(this)\" style=\"margin-top:24px\">Check my answers</button>\n      <div class=\"res\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"reviewResult\" class=\"review-result\"></div>\n  </section>\n"}